<table align='CENTER' cellpadding='2' border='1' cellspacing='2' background='http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif'><TR><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?month=11">This Month</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?month=10">October-2001</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?month=9">September-2001</A></TD></TR><TR><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?month=8">August-2001</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?month=7">July-2001</A></TD><TD><a HREF="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/newspages/news.php?month=6">June-2001</A></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>Is that an EPIC pet in your pocket?</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Saturday - July 7th 2001</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif" cellpadding="5" border="0" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'><TABLE><TR><TD> <a href='http://www.guild-legerdemain.com/memberfiles/user1/Katrel_a.jpg' target='_Katrel'><img border='0' src='http://www.guild-legerdemain.com/memberfiles/user1/Katrel_b.jpg'></A> </TD>  <TD VALIGN='TOP'> <p class='text'> Katrel <b>finally</b> got his epic!!!!  Congratulate him if you havent already. The mage epic is no piece of cake.  The picture shows Katrel having a conversation with the Master of Elements in the Plane of Air.  I think Katrels saying something along the lines of -- PLEASE! please please please....  -- </P></TD></TR> </TABLE></font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font face='monotype sorts' size='+1'>) </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>New class--- Beastlord??</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Thursday - July 5th 2001</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif" cellpadding="5" border="0" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'><p class='text'> Legerdemain had a couple run-in's with the beasts of Norrath recently. </p> <TABLE><TR><TD> <a href='http://www.guild-legerdemain.com/memberfiles/user1/Celly_a.jpg' target='_Celly'><img border='0' src='http://www.guild-legerdemain.com/memberfiles/user1/Celly_b.jpg'></A> </TD>  <TD VALIGN='TOP'> <p class='text'> Here's Celly finding out what happens when you grab a tiger by its tail </P></TD></TR>  <TR><TD> <a href='http://www.guild-legerdemain.com/memberfiles/user1/Rold_a.jpg' target='_Rold'><img border='0' src='http://www.guild-legerdemain.com/memberfiles/user1/Rold_b.jpg'></A> </TD>  <TD VALIGN='TOP'> <p class='text'> Here's Bahn and Roldanious taking advantage of poor Giber. <p> </TD></TR></TABLE></font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font face='monotype sorts' size='+1'>) </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth</a></font></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE align="center" width="85%" border="0"  margin="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><TR><TD ALIGN="center"><IMG SRC="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/La.jpg"></TD><TD width="40%" VALIGN="center" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face='Impact'>City of Mist - been there, done that</font></TD><TD VALIGN="center" ALIGN="right" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif"><font size='-1' face='Georgia'>Wednesday - July 4th 2001</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width="85%" align="CENTER" background="http://www.Guild-Legerdemain.com/images/texture3.gif" cellpadding="5" border="0" margin="0" cellspacing="0"><TR><TD><font face='comic sans ms'><p class='text'>Embren(53chanter), Aynn(51chanter), Silvaer(51chanter), Scarzz(50ish?Monk), Katrel(56mage), Sagera(53pally), Boramur(53pally), Brelen(51cleric), Keymarad(56cleric), Roldanious(51mage), and Tienen(58druid) broke in to COM.  It took quite some time, but we broke through all the way to the 2nd house.  After a few left, the remaining eight people moved on to hold the 3rd house on the tip top of COM for many many hours.</p><p class='text'>We ended up getting Roldanious and Katrel <i>Ornate Rune Shields</i> and Katrel finally got the Torch for the mage epic--his LAST piece.  Our little party, slaphappy tired, decided to stay for ONE MORE reaver hehe.  This particular reaver, however, decided to deathspawn 4 more friends, one right after the other.  On our fifth reaver in a row, a wraith of Jaxion, a wraith, a phantom, two goos, and a mist golem... we finally perished.</p><p class='text'>The CR was done by necros summoning our corpses to the zone.  All-in-all we had a great, exciting, adventerous time.  I hope that we can do more things like this in the future.</P></font><BR><font size='-2' face='arial'>------submitted by </font><font face='monotype sorts' size='+1'>) </font><font size='-1' face='arial'><a href=mailto:Terrenoth@yahoo.com>Terrenoth